<title>ZeroStick</title>
<!-- ══ The app's home is the EXO app's device list (D264, 2026-10-10) ══════
     One app for both ZeroStick devices: the device list (exo/devices.html)
     offers ZeroStick Core and the ZeroStick Calibration Dongle, the same two
     tiles the desktop exe shows. Both apps' files are copied into www/exo/
     by the EXO repo's dashboard/tools/sync-mobile.js; the dongle's screens
     are www/exo/dongle/ (their source of truth is the EXO repo's
     dashboard/public/dongle/ now, not this repo's old www/dongle.html).

     This page only forwards. location.replace, so Android's back button never
     lands on a blank page. The list itself remembers the last device used
     and opens it (Cronus behaviour); "Your devices" inside a product goes to
     exo/devices.html?pick=1, which always shows the list.

     Nothing is asked for here (no Bluetooth, no WiFi, no location): each
     product page asks only after the customer picks it. -->
<script>
  location.replace('exo/devices.html' + location.search + location.hash);
</script>
<style>
  html,body{margin:0;min-height:100%;background:#080b11;color:#e8f0f8;
